{"3337130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RMF's Ragdoll Physics Experiments", "steam_appid": 3337130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/2784a4113b226ef7cdf187bd97aac906.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RMF's Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong> is a single-player, room-based comedy experience where physics-driven interaction unfolds inside a strange world full of commentary, challenges, secrets, and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each space introduces a new idea, surprise, or objective, creating a strong sense of rhythm and variety. The result is an experience that blends playful destruction with structure, atmosphere, and a very distinct personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3614d77ded338251004bd84e30e58e64.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3614d77ded338251004bd84e30e58e64.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3614d77ded338251004bd84e30e58e64.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/52adb5b00973bbd939a68b86eb59e5bc.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RMF's Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong> started life as a YouTube animation series by Rate My Funeral. The idea was simple: let physics create the comedy. Ragdolls would inevitably end up in ridiculous situations, and the humour came from timing, absurdity, and impacts that felt strangely satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5977b374a668b09eb877fd12079a8237.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5977b374a668b09eb877fd12079a8237.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5977b374a668b09eb877fd12079a8237.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a15979bc37527518e4d77bfe2e69d60d.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, the idea surfaced: <strong>What if this became a game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same spirit of playful experimentation now sits at the heart of RPX. Players explore a mysterious testing facility filled with unusual contraptions, strange rooms, hidden surprises, and challenge spaces that each bring a new twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/aa8d75fe3eb047e9453d55c3fb3e745c.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/aa8d75fe3eb047e9453d55c3fb3e745c.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/aa8d75fe3eb047e9453d55c3fb3e745c.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some moments are about causing chaos. Others are about observation, timing, experimentation, or simply figuring out what the facility wants from you. Throughout it all, the Voice of the Facility is never far away, commenting on your actions with a mix of guidance, judgement, and suspicious enthusiasm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3a2b62e7668ed4e2d1e304cdc40dd133.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3a2b62e7668ed4e2d1e304cdc40dd133.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/3a2b62e7668ed4e2d1e304cdc40dd133.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a comedy game where physics create the fun, but structure, pacing, and atmosphere are what make the experience memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/219ba957d0b3642600a7bbcf43934b14.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPX is not just about throwing objects around and watching ragdolls collapse in a heap, although that is certainly part of the appeal. The game is built around carefully designed rooms, reactive comedy, strange facility logic, and a growing sense that something is not quite right behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines tactile physics interaction with crafted spaces, strong sound design, hidden details, and a narrator-led tone that gives the whole experience its own identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/907a6160765863237135baad526524c9.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is available here on Steam, so you can experience RPX for yourself. Meet the Voice of the Facility, explore the opening areas of the testing complex, and get a feel for the game’s blend of comedy, mystery, and physics-driven interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with playful experimentation, but it does not take long before the facility begins to feel like it has plans of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b2bdfe91036abef806e72ac9550465f7.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the RPX community as the game grows, share feedback, and help shape what comes next. You might even end up with your name in the credits. A free boat is less certain, but we are not ruling it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/2784a4113b226ef7cdf187bd97aac906.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RMF's Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong> is a single-player, room-based comedy experience where physics-driven interaction unfolds inside a strange world full of commentary, challenges, secrets, and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b739f791eca1d5fc872e62c1cdeb4e0f.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each space introduces a new idea, surprise, or objective, creating a strong sense of rhythm and variety. The result is an experience that blends playful destruction with structure, atmosphere, and a very distinct personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/ex