apps/3337130/extras/3a2b62e7668ed4e2d1e304cdc40dd133.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a comedy game where physics create the fun, but structure, pacing, and atmosphere are what make the experience memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/219ba957d0b3642600a7bbcf43934b14.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPX is not just about throwing objects around and watching ragdolls collapse in a heap, although that is certainly part of the appeal. The game is built around carefully designed rooms, reactive comedy, strange facility logic, and a growing sense that something is not quite right behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/fb6e3373e6c2f0cca35a02357ddd7db4.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines tactile physics interaction with crafted spaces, strong sound design, hidden details, and a narrator-led tone that gives the whole experience its own identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/907a6160765863237135baad526524c9.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is available here on Steam, so you can experience RPX for yourself. Meet the Voice of the Facility, explore the opening areas of the testing complex, and get a feel for the game’s blend of comedy, mystery, and physics-driven interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with playful experimentation, but it does not take long before the facility begins to feel like it has plans of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.webm?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c7c627062d32c397a6054192520c4cc8.mp4?t=1784799591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b2bdfe91036abef806e72ac9550465f7.avif?t=1784799591\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the RPX community as the game grows, share feedback, and help shape what comes next. You might even end up with your name in the credits. A free boat is less certain, but we are not ruling it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.poster.avif?t=1784799591\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.a